{"unit_id":"YubaiLoving__dsh-context-annotations#card-zh","repo":"YubaiLoving/dsh-context-annotations","commit":"b2a07e813968ddf3b584caf2bb63ba106b6bb925","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-annotations 是面向 DSH Web 对话的文本批注插件：在对话中选择片段并写下注释，注释通过下一轮上下文提供给模型。浏览器端加入浮动批注按钮、原文标记和注释面板，Host 端按会话暂存批次并在发送时加入提示词。可编辑或删除批注，也可在没有正文时单独发送批注。适合需要围绕对话具体片段补充说明的用户；无需 API Key 或额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1801-1818","lib/index.js:349-366"]}
{"unit_id":"YubaiLoving__dsh-context-annotations#card-en","repo":"YubaiLoving/dsh-context-annotations","commit":"b2a07e813968ddf3b584caf2bb63ba106b6bb925","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-context-annotations adds notes to selected passages in DSH Web conversations. Review, edit, or remove notes in the composer panel; numbered markers link them to passages. The Host includes notes in the next turn’s prompt, or sends them alone. No API key or extra configuration is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1801-1818","lib/index.js:349-366"]}
